572
01:36:53.934 --> 01:36:56.564
I just wanted to meet you
before they got here.

573
01:36:57.729 --> 01:36:59.309
I wanted to meet...

574
01:37:03.235 --> 01:37:07.485
I wanted to meet the man
whom my wife fell in love with.

575
01:38:02.544 --> 01:38:05.304
<i>Hi.
This Ok-Ja.

576
01:38:05.755 --> 01:38:08.715
<i>Please leave your message.
